<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Creciente - 140,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $7.25 fio scale load/40,000 shinc 22/3-7/4 P &amp; O.</p>
<p>ORE - Loire Ore - 120,000 tonnes Hampton Roads/Ijmuiden 18-28/2 $5.50 fio six days shinc Cetragpa (ammends rate and cargo).</p>
</text>
